<!-- Add this one -->
<PackageReference Include="MSTest" Version="3.8.0" />
```

**2. Assertion overloads** — `Assert.AreEqual(object, object)` and `Assert.AreSame(object, object)` were removed. Add generic type parameters:

```csharp
// Line 13 — before:
Assert.AreEqual(expected, actual);
// After:
Assert.AreEqual<object>(expected, actual);

// Line 20 — before:
Assert.AreSame(obj, obj);
// After:
Assert.AreSame<object>(obj, obj);
```

**3. DataRow strict type matching** — `1L`/`2L` (long) won't implicitly convert to the `int` parameter. Fix the parameter type or literals:

```csharp
