public void GetUserName_ReturnsCorrectName(int id, string expectedName)

// After (change parameter to long):
[DataRow(1L, "Alice")]
[DataRow(2L, "Bob")]
public void GetUserName_ReturnsCorrectName(long id, string expectedName)
```

**4. Target framework** — `net6.0` is supported by v3, so no TFM change is required (though note .NET 6 is end-of-life; consider `net8.0`).

